{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0164_1000_p", "source_sha256": "171b391d916e2d2f4f838a35b2f97d1c155a639fd926089fd05ac744692723f9", "ja": "（もうすぐ、紬のグラビア撮影が始まる。\n緊張しているのか、少し表情が硬いな……）", "zh": "（紬的写真拍摄马上就要开始了。\n是因为紧张吗，她的表情有点僵硬啊……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0164_1001_051tmg", "source_sha256": "7641118ce98361e06ed7a82acbad1afd72c54d9a43effc1368a0a6c4e6dac2e3", "ja": "う、腕はこうして……視線は、上げ気味に。\nちゃんと予習したし、教わったとおりにやれば……。", "zh": "手、手臂要这样……视线，要稍微往上抬一点。\n已经好好预习过了，只要按照教的来做就……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0164_1002_p", "source_sha256": "5ce08d7a0c27eebc449582df07ab1a3742b3632542bafa4cb10f8b03401d7065", "ja": "紬、大丈夫か？　もうすぐ始まるけど……。", "zh": "紬，没事吧？马上就要开始了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0164_1003_051tmg", "source_sha256": "7fd7ddb1ff2e8647bdc0a7a01556a75fa2af383e34bce3191cbfd3f31bb1cabf", "ja": "だ、大丈夫です。\nその、ポーズの確認をしていただけですから。", "zh": "没、没事的。\n那个，我只是在确认姿势而已。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0164_1004_051tmg", "source_sha256": "a87919950206caed4e727fda6d4e9cd747e0fe35acb0862e401b296300877795", "ja": "劇場の、グラビアの経験が多い皆さんに、コツを\n伝授していただきました。何も問題はありません。", "zh": "剧场里有很多写真拍摄经验的各位，已经把诀窍传授给我了。没有任何问题。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0164_1005_p", "source_sha256": "166a18a7676b3204d08fee5bf5a43ba5f5fe9a02457af583cefdbe8f0b3aac99", "ja": "そ、そうか。……誰から、\nどんなコツを伝授してもらったんだ？", "zh": "这、这样啊……你是从谁那里，学到了什么诀窍？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0164_1006_051tmg", "source_sha256": "c9edf72de571ebb2b66c4662e4bf7d9d0de4a044f8e9d9c6a9896fa3e8bd95a0", "ja": "教えていただいたのは、豊川さん、所さん。\nそれに百瀬さん、馬場さんです。", "zh": "教我的人是丰川小姐、所小姐。\n还有百濑小姐和马场小姐。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0164_1007_p", "source_sha256": "26ab6242da93b096d2ba659903fe14690730cf7f7de65634cd94af05efe70377", "ja": "（……方向性がちょっと違う面々だ！）", "zh": "（……这几个人的方向性有点不一样啊！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0164_1008_051tmg", "source_sha256": "f7503df44e4939c3486204907fc7fa795d44dc24667fa48ad2c65141f835012c", "ja": "皆さん、グラビア経験が豊富で、美しく魅力的な\nポーズのとり方にもお詳しい方ばかり……。", "zh": "各位都有丰富的写真经验，也全都是很了解如何摆出美丽迷人姿势的人……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0164_1009_051tmg", "source_sha256": "f8c5d2e1be31826280e72dc8014d5855d59fd27d3eb63e429cc0ae1571df050b", "ja": "人目を惹く仕草など、\nいろいろ教えていただきました。", "zh": "还教了我许多吸引目光的动作之类的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0164_1010_p", "source_sha256": "554a69c756b1f2b48dda61af298346991e4b17a82dd738ae00dc989ca123468f", "ja": "な、なるほど。\nところで、今日の撮影についてなんだけど……。", "zh": "原、原来如此。\n对了，关于今天的拍摄……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0164_1011_p", "source_sha256": "7d070ca7cd882de01b23e261bb90a74bd7f732ef712a2775dd682a7ea6361d0e", "ja": "「思わず目を惹かれる少女」がテーマだって事は、\n事前に伝えていたよな？", "zh": "主题是“让人不由自主被吸引的少女”，\n这件事事前有跟你说过吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0164_1012_051tmg", "source_sha256": "e987d8a9e0298c2972f4681ce0fbc4605d209784321adf80fb0875de3f6d4754", "ja": "ええ。ですから、こういった……水着にも似た\n衣装で見せる、妖艶さ……という意味では……？", "zh": "嗯。所以，如果是指通过这种……类似泳装的服装展现出的妖艳感……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0164_1013_p", "source_sha256": "14ace7779e54f9b843e1b72288e350c07995b18b53a2cf636263d8193be4f743", "ja": "それもなくはないけど……例えば紬は、\n街でどんな女性に出会ったら、目を惹かれる？", "zh": "也不是没有……比如说，紬，你在街上遇到什么样的女性，会让你忍不住多看几眼？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0164_1014_051tmg", "source_sha256": "83be2f4b8869db05c5c60010a98076deeb3f51697a3668a909a0bae7bca921f2", "ja": "私ですか？　私は……仕立ての良い着物を着こなし、\n所作の美しい方を見ると……はっ。", "zh": "我吗？我……看到身着剪裁精良、穿得得体的和服，举止又优美的人，就会……啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0164_1015_051tmg", "source_sha256": "6312e7fe76943179e5184c54d16e5bebb07c231c4085ce980c07c72ca7d42a2b", "ja": "もしや……それは、水着でも同じ。\nあなたは、そう仰りたいのですか？", "zh": "难道说……换作泳装也是同理。\n您是想这么说吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0164_1016_051tmg", "source_sha256": "75fe33ac8af68276186ca9210906b4d8e3931178c0619cb052fafb8461a33b96", "ja": "何気ない美しさを撮る予定だったのに、私は、\n妖艶さにばかり気を取られていた……と？", "zh": "明明计划拍摄的是不经意间流露的美，我却一直只顾着关注那份妖艳……您的意思是这样吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0164_1017_p", "source_sha256": "bda67ccf29a230746f99dab8b6dd8742af2145c43c6346bb07c8dd7e0e1282f4", "ja": "そうだな……妖艶さも間違いじゃないんだけど。\n今回は、年齢相応の紬らしさを大事にしたいというか。", "zh": "是啊……妖艳也没错，不过这次，我更想展现出符合紬这个年纪的她的特点。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0164_1018_051tmg", "source_sha256": "60fd28ed863dc7ceb9c4f2fc4e2865a461739d204fae7aca2947b8312d33a8de", "ja": "そ、そういう大事なことは、先に言ってください！\nが、がんこ恥ずかしい失敗、するところやった……。", "zh": "那、那么重要的事，请先说啊！\n差、差点就犯下超级丢脸的错误了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0164_1019_p", "source_sha256": "280a4f65636e3887261ece42ba21ed93734907a7905211f6ca5dca7f6ac85421", "ja": "ご、ごめん……。でも、紬も撮影の事を\n色々考えてくれてたんだな。ありがとう！", "zh": "对、对不起……不过，没想到紬也一直在为拍摄的事考虑各种事情。谢谢你！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0164_1020_051tmg", "source_sha256": "8eb8265bdf6cb5b6fe6fbf02330c316d89fe6f2bdf690bb80db093abcf19e0da", "ja": "当然です！　お仕事をさせていただくからには、\nきちんとやり遂げないとと思って……はぁ。", "zh": "这是当然的！既然接下了这份工作，\n我就想着必须要好好完成才行……唉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0164_1021_051tmg", "source_sha256": "2c58c12aebe3d8c214a1accbde80b2d86221140bd9941cee6761ed5f2969fd94", "ja": "なんだか、気が抜けてしまいました。けど今なら、\n緊張せずに気楽に臨めそうです……ふふっ！", "zh": "不知怎么的，一下子松懈下来了。不过现在的话，应该能不紧张、放松地面对了……呵呵！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
